l is a delivery-only handshake and is never persisted, so it does not appear here. For the full list of events and the live delivery envelope, see the ",[215,216,217],"a",{"href":39},"Webhooks guide",".",[220,221,223],"h3",{"id":222},"properties","Properties",[225,226,227,243],"table",{},[228,229,230],"thead",{},[231,232,233,237,240],"tr",{},[234,235,236],"th",{},"Name",[234,238,239],{},"Type",[234,241,242],{},"Description",[244,245,246,266,283,313,348,362,392,406,421],"tbody",{},[231,247,248,254,259],{},[249,250,251],"td",{},[210,252,253],{},"id",[249,255,256],{},[210,257,258],{},"string",[249,260,261,262,265],{},"Unique identifier for the webhook event (starts with ",[210,263,264],{},"webhook_event_",").",[231,267,268,273,277],{},[249,269,270],{},[210,271,272],{},"resource",[249,274,275],{},[210,276,258],{},[249,278,279,280,218],{},"The resource type. Always ",[210,281,282],{},"webhook_event",[231,284,285,290,294],{},[249,286,287],{},[210,288,289],{},"eventName",[249,291,292],{},[210,293,258],{},[249,295,296,297,300,301,304,305,308,309,312],{},"The event name, such as ",[210,298,299],{},"order.paid",", ",[210,302,303],{},"refund.completed",", or ",[210,306,307],{},"subscription_plan.update_approved",". See the ",[215,310,217],{"href":311},"/guides/webhooks#event-types"," for the full list.",[231,314,315,320,324],{},[249,316,317],{},[210,318,319],{},"entityType",[249,321,322],{},[210,323,258],{},[249,325,326,327,300,330,300,333,300,336,300,339,300,342,304,345,218],{},"The resource type the event refers to, such as ",[210,328,329],{},"order",[210,331,332],{},"refund",[210,334,335],{},"chargeback",[210,337,338],{},"subscription",[210,340,341],{},"checkout",[210,343,344],{},"one_off_product",[210,346,347],{},"subscription_plan",[231,349,350,355,359],{},[249,351,352],{},[210,353,354],{},"entityId",[249,356,357],{},[210,358,258],{},[249,360,361],{},"The ID of the related resource.",[231,363,364,369,373],{},[249,365,366],{},[210,367,368],{},"object",[249,370,371],{},[210,372,368],{},[249,374,375,376,378,379,382,383,385,386,389,390,218],{},"The full resource payload as it existed when the event occurred (an Order, Chargeback, Refund, Subscription, Checkout, OneOffProduct, or SubscriptionPlan), keyed by its own ",[210,377,272],{}," field. Note ",[210,380,381],{},"object.resource"," can differ from ",[210,384,319],{},": chargeback events carry ",[210,387,388],{},"entityType: order"," but a Chargeback ",[210,391,368],{},[231,393,394,399,403],{},[249,395,396],{},[210,397,398],{},"createdAt",[249,400,401],{},[210,402,258],{},[249,404,405],{},"When the event occurred (ISO 8601 format).",[231,407,408,413,418],{},[249,409,410],{},[210,411,412],{},"testmode",[249,414,415],{},[210,416,417],{},"boolean",[249,419,420],{},"Whether the event originated from a test-mode resource.",[231,422,423,428,432],{},[249,424,425],{},[210,426,427],{},"links",[249,429,430],{},[210,431,368],{},[249,433,434,435,218],{},"HATEOAS links. Contains ",[210,436,437],{},"self",[439,440],"hr",{},[196,442,444],{"id":443},"get-a-webhook-event","Get a webhook event",[201,446,447],{},[210,448,449],{},"GET /v1/webhook-events/:eventId",[201,451,452],{},"This endpoint returns the full webhook event payload for a specific event ID.",[220,454,456],{"id":455},"parameters","Parameters",[225,458,459,469],{},[228,460,461],{},[231,462,463,465,467],{},[234,464,236],{},[234,466,239],{},[234,468,242],{},[244,470,471],{},[231,472,473,478,482],{},[249,474,475],{},[210,476,477],{},"eventId",[249,479,480],{},[210,481,258],{},[249,483,484],{},"The unique identifier of the webhook event.",[486,487,489,531,645],"code-group",{"sync":488},"api",[490,491,496],"pre",{"className":492,"code":493,"filename":494,"language":495,"meta":109,"style":109},"language-bash shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","curl https://api.vatly.com/v1/webhook-events/webhook_event_Qk8pRtSvWm2NjLhYcZaE \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer live_your_api_key_here\"\n","cURL","bash",[2